  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Consultation Form Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a consultation form?\", \"a\": \"A consultation form is a short questionnaire a client fills in before a first meeting with a professional, such as a stylist or a designer. It records what the client wants and what they can spend. With those details read in advance, the meeting can start on the real question.\"}, {\"q\": \"How to make a client consultation form?\", \"a\": \"Start with what the answers should change, such as who takes the meeting or how long it runs. Then describe your service and your questions to Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder'>AI form builder</a>. It builds the form with its routing, along with a table that keeps every response.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is a consultation form for estheticians?\", \"a\": \"Estheticians use one to learn about a client's skin before a facial, including the current routine and any recent treatments. The answers shape which products the esthetician reaches for. For a version built around skin studios, see the esthetician intake form.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is an example of a consultation form?\", \"a\": \"A wedding photographer's form is a typical one. It asks for the date, the venue, the guest count, and which parts of the day the couple wants covered. The photographer reads it before the call and quotes from real details instead of guesses.\"}, {\"q\": \"Where can I find a consultation form template?\", \"a\": \"Form builder galleries carry consultation forms for most service types. Emergent starts from your description instead and writes questions for your business. Name the service and the decisions the answers drive. Compared with a consultation form template, you skip deleting the questions that do not fit.\"}, {\"q\": \"Is there a free consultation form I can use?\", \"a\": \"Emergent is free to start, and the free tier covers building and publishing a form. Describe your service and you get a free consultation form at a link clients can open on any phone. Every answer is saved to a database you own.\"}, {\"q\": \"Should a consultation form be paper or online?\", \"a\": \"Online suits most businesses. A consultation form PDF is easy to print or email, but each completed copy has to be read and filed by hand. A web form saves every answer to a table you can sort and search, and clients fill it in on their phones.\"}, {\"q\": \"What questions should consultation forms include?\", \"a\": \"Start with contact details and the service the client wants. Then ask for their goal and their budget, plus anything that changes how the meeting runs. Cut any question whose answer you would not act on.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is a discovery call form?\", \"a\": \"A discovery call form is what consultants and agencies send before a first sales call. It asks what the company does and what prompted the call. The person taking the call reads it beforehand and spends the time on whether the work is a fit.\"}, {\"q\": \"What questions go on a massage consultation form?\", \"a\": \"It asks which areas need work and how much pressure the client likes. It also asks about anything the therapist should avoid, such as a recent injury, with the health questions set by your practice. For a fuller version, see the <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder/massage-intake-form'>massage intake form</a>.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
}